# Using Java and Kotlin[¶](https://docs.kanzi.com/4.1.0/en/working-with/java/using-java.html#using-java-and-kotlin "Link to this heading")
![](https://docs.kanzi.com/4.1.0/en/_static/copy-to-clipboard.svg) Copy page ![](https://docs.kanzi.com/4.1.0/en/_static/arrow-down.svg)
